    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78261" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρα-κρίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>judge falsely</i>, Hsch.
