				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραβραβεύων</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be drawn up in line opposite</i>, <i><span class="en">
